### Create a new investigation (runs the agent and returns the finished run)
POST http://localhost:8080/connect-ai/api/investigations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Why are orders stuck in Payment Processing?" }

### List (newest first). All parameters are optional
GET http://localhost:8080/connect-ai/api/investigations?status=ANSWERED&archived=false&q=payment&page=0&size=20

### Get one investigation with its evidence (paste an id from the list)
GET http://localhost:8080/connect-ai/api/investigations/{{id}}

### Evidence only
GET http://localhost:8080/connect-ai/api/investigations/{{id}}/evidence
